{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/e75667caf51b86d177dcfd7294f173db.poster.avif?t=1758732821\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/e75667caf51b86d177dcfd7294f173db.webm?t=1758732821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Step into the delightful world of running your very own maid caf\u00e9! In this idle incremental game, your goal is to grow a bustling caf\u00e9 filled with charm, style, and hardworking maids.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire new maids, each with their own abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/8e497f17f508985b39538a2a4b0c2c1b.avif?t=1758732821\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and upgrade news options on the caf\u00e9 menu.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/55669aecd3eac1c8820877c4c993aa70.avif?t=1758732821\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expand your caf\u00e9 by purchasing decorations and customizing the interior to reflect your unique style.<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/4040926f6f97f999d9fd15696842008e.avif?t=1758732821\" width=600 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you actively manage your staff or let the game run while you\u2019re away, your caf\u00e9 keeps working for you. Progress at your own pace, unlock upgrades, and see just how big and beautiful your maid caf\u00e9 can become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax, strategize, and enjoy building the perfect combination of style and efficiency in your dream maid caf\u00e9!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/38afd8d9b557f305959d8aaae2a7cf5e.poster.avif?t=1758732821\" width=601 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/38afd8d9b557f305959d8aaae2a7cf5e.webm?t=1758732821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4014030?t=1758732821","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/7df91fa6d70a26fd71d551b080069869f5cfdb67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758732821","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/491201d28174b1faf50dc02b0da2acd66877bdc0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758732821","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/491201d28174b1faf50dc02b0da2acd66877bdc0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758732821","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/e75667caf51b86d177dcfd7294f173db.poster.avif?t=1758732821\" width=600 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4014030/extras/e75667